SUMMARY:May Write-In: Light
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Literary Arts Bookstore & Cafe for our monthly write-in. \nAt last\, the long night has ended\, and we’re ready for Spring! With a bookseller-curated mix of songs featuring sunlight and brightness\, we’ll be channeling brighter days as we lock-in for a focused writing session. \nOur Food and Beverage Assistant Manager\, Miah\, cooked up a new special called Lemon Illumination!  For one night only\, we are bringing back the lemon thyme latte! This is one of our favorite seasonal specials. It’s lemony\, herby\, and all around delicious!
